  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 206.02 Rulemaking Public Comment Hearing. A public comment hearing shall be held by the board when proposing to adopt, amend, or repeal a rule or rules.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
